      "text | Anyone can use a <b>Bonus Action</b> to drink or administer one to a creature within <code style='padding:2px 4px;font-size:90%;color:#c7254e;background:#f9f2f4;border-radius:4px;'>5ft</code>.",
      "text | As a <b>Magic Action</b>, expend a <code style='padding:2px 4px;font-size:90%;color:#c7254e;background:#f9f2f4;border-radius:4px;'>spell slot</code> to brew an elixir of your choice.",
