    "icon_front": "potion-ball white-book-5",
    "contents": [
      "text | When casting a spell using your <code style='padding:2px 4px;font-size:90%;color:#c7254e;background:#f9f2f4;border-radius:4px;'>Alchemist's Supplies</code> as your <b>Spellcasting Focus</b>, you may add your <b>Intelligence modifier</b> (minimum +1) to <i>one</i> of the healing or damage spell's rolls:",
